<title>BELGIUM: Belgian 3rd quarter GDP rises 0.5 pct q/q.</title>
<headline>Belgian 3rd quarter GDP rises 0.5 pct q/q.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank gave the following new estimates of gross domestic product growth in its weekly economic indicators statement -</p>
<p>GDP (in percent)</p>
<p>		Q3 1996   Q2 1996   Q1 1996   Q4 1995   Q3 1995</p>
<p> qtr-on-qtr  0.5	 3.6	 1.7	 2.2	 -0.2</p>
<p> yr-on-yr    1.9	 1.8	 0.6	 0.7	  1.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Quarterly data seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
